    "LP units go +1 then -1; returned asset ratio changes from 2:4 to 1.5:5. REBASE 10 increases by stated 1 to 11. Failed transfer consumes only GAS 0.1, leaving 1.9.",
    "NFT token 1 moves A to B while token 2 remains in A. Fork 1 and airdrop 2 have unknown principal and fees, not zero cost.",
    "Retracted orphan-block receipt 4 has no recognized effect. A replacement canonical receipt 1 is distinct from the later recognized reversal 0.5."
  ],
